LOCAL
PGM_FIELDS
lUplFoto		STRING		21

IMAGE(tmptranst)
/---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
 /--------s.UPLOAD--------------\/-----------------------------------------------\
 |                              || t.Berkas ____________________________________ |
 |                              ||          _______                              |
 |                              ||          spasi                                |
 |                              ||          ____________                         |
 |                              ||                                               |
 \------------------------------/\-----------------------------------------------/
